#: ../../../boards/teensy/teensylc.rst:22
msgid ""
"Platform :ref:`platform_teensy`: Teensy is a complete USB-based "
"microcontroller development system, in a very small footprint, capable of "
"implementing many types of projects. All programming is done via the USB "
"port. No special programmer is needed, only a standard USB cable and a PC or "
"Macintosh with a USB port."
